  "interpretation": "<p><strong>Result Summary:</strong></p>\n<p>del(17p13) &ndash; Detected -&gt; Suggestive of high-risk cytogenetics</p>\n<p>t(11;14) &ndash; Detected -&gt; May predict response to BCL2-targeted therapy</p>\n<p>Other abnormalities: Not Detected</p>\n<ul>\n<li>These findings indicate intermediate to high-risk multiple myeloma.</li>\n<li>FISH abnormalities guide risk stratification and therapy decisions (e.g., proteasome inhibitors, BCL2 inhibitors).</li>\n</ul>",
